## English (translation; the Chinese version governs)

### You MAY

1. Read, download, and locally store the contents of this repository;
2. Use them for personal study and research;
3. Quote short excerpts in articles, videos, or discussions, provided you credit the source and link back to this repository.

### You MAY NOT

1. **Commercial use.** Selling, paid courses, commercial training, advertising or traffic monetization, or any direct or indirect for-profit use.
2. **Derivatives and redistribution.** Republishing in full, publishing modified versions, translating, adapting, or compiling derivative works — without prior written permission.
3. **AI training and distillation.** Using any part of this repository — full text, excerpts, structure, examples, outlines — to train, fine-tune, distill, or evaluate any machine learning model, or to include it in any training corpus or retrieval-augmented (RAG) knowledge base. No exceptions; no implied consent.

### Permission

Any exception (commercial licensing, translation and republication, AI-related uses) must be requested in advance via an Issue in this repository. Silence means refusal.

